~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Percival: *Draped in a velvet cloak, holding a goblet of deep crimson liquid with pale, manicured hands.*
Percival: Ah... magnificent. Entrez, my delicate suitor.
Percival: Do not be nervous. I rarely bite on a first date... unless politely requested.

- "Your elegance and presence are truly breathtaking."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 8)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Cheeks flush a delicate rose hue, eyes softening with romantic intensity.*
		Percival: Ah, a person of exquisite taste! You speak straight to my immortal soul...
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Smiles with aristocratic poise, tipping his goblet.*
		Percival: Ah, a person of refined taste! Finally, someone who appreciates true immortal poise.
	=> main_hub

- "I couldn't help but notice your pale skin and sub-normal warmth."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Percival: *Chuckles softly, swirling the vintage plasma in his glass.*
	Percival: A keen observer! Sanguine body temperature rests comfortably at eighteen degrees. Cold flesh, warm heart.
	=> main_hub

- "Do you ever stop being so dramatically theatrical?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -10)
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Percival: *His smile stiffens slightly, dark eyes flashing.*
	Percival: Hmph. Vulgar mortal. Dramatic flair is a high art form, not a performance for peasants.
	=> main_hub

- "Keep your distance, bat-wings. I don't trust blood-drinkers."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -20)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: *Fangs extend slightly beneath his top lip, voice turning icy cold.*
		Percival: How dreadfully uncouth. Mind your tongue, suitor, or this evening will take a predatory turn.
		=> main_hub


~ main_hub
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 0:
	=> horror_exit

do GameManager.set_expression("normal")

# Check if all main topics have been explored
if GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_poetry") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_fashion") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_vintage") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_schedule") and GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_mirror"):
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Holding his hand over his heart, gazing at you with passion.*
		Percival: My sweet suitor... we have shared such magnificent secrets beneath the velvet night.
		Percival: My ancient heart beats only for your companionship.
	elif GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: *Looking at you with cold aristocratic disdain.*
		Percival: We have conversed quite enough for one evening.
		Percival: I am ready for this rendezvous to conclude.
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Swirling his goblet with a polite smile.*
		Percival: We have covered a great deal tonight, suitor.
		Percival: It has been a most enchanting conversation.
	
	- "I've cherished our romantic evening, Percival."
		do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 5)
		=> end_date
	- "That concludes our encounter for tonight."
		=> end_date

# Dynamic hub greetings based strictly on Affection tiers
elif GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
	do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
	Percival: *Leaning closer, taking a slow sip of vintage blood as a subtle blush covers his pale cheeks.*
	Percival: My delicate suitor... every moment with you feels like a verse from a gothic sonnet.
	Percival: What dark secret shall we whisper about next?
	=> hub_choices

elif GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Percival: *Dark eyes gleaming in the dim light, resting his goblet on the table with a sharp clink.*
	Percival: You are treading on dangerously thin velvet, suitor.
	Percival: Speak quickly... my patience for your uncouth probing is nearly exhausted.
	=> hub_choices

else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Percival: *Swirling the dark crimson liquid in his goblet with timeless poise.*
	Percival: So, my suitor... what secrets of the night shall we explore next?
	=> hub_choices


~ hub_choices
# Only valid/unasked topics are shown. Options with false conditions are hidden automatically!

- "Tell me about your seventeen volumes of gothic poetry." [if not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_poetry")]
	=> poetry_topic

- "What noble fashion standards do you expect in romance?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_fashion")]
	=> fashion_topic

- "Tell me about your connoisseurship of blood vintages." [if GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_poetry") and not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_vintage")]
	=> vintage_topic

- "What is your daily nocturnal schedule and sleep routine?" [if GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_fashion") and not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_schedule")]
	=> schedule_topic

- "How do your noble traits react to silver glass and mirrors?" [if GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_vintage") and not GameManager.has_flag("vampire", "asked_mirror")]
	=> mirror_topic

- "I think I have learned enough for our encounter today."
	=> end_date


~ poetry_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_poetry")
Percival: Seventeen volumes composed over centuries in pitch-black gothic mausoleums!
Percival: Would you care to hear a stanza about moonlight dripping like silver tears over velvet graves?

- "I would be deeply honored to hear your sonnet."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Gazing into your eyes, voice dropping to a passionate whisper.*
		Percival: 'O crimson night, thy velvet veil enfolds my lonely pulse...' Breathtaking, is it not?
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Recites dramatically with open hand.*
		Percival: 'O crimson night, thy velvet veil enfolds my lonely pulse...' Breathtaking, is it not?
	=> main_hub

- "Isn't writing poetry about graves a bit depressing?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Percival: Depressing? Art is meant to disturb the comfortable and elevate the soul!
	Percival: Melancholy is the truest form of romantic passion.
	=> main_hub

- "Gothic poetry sounds boring and pretentious."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -40)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	elif GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: *Sets his goblet down violently, eyes flaring red.*
		Percival: Pretentious?! You have the artistic soul of a garden slug!
		Percival: Do not insult my life's work again.
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: *Frowns deeply, dark eyes narrowing.*
		Percival: Pretentious?! You have the artistic soul of a garden slug!
	=> main_hub


~ fashion_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_fashion")
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Percival: To love a vampire is to embrace commitment and high aesthetic perfection!
Percival: I do not merely date, suitor—I commit completely to sensory elegance!
Percival: Tell me, what is your ideal romantic evening?

- "A quiet moonlight stroll through an ancient Victorian rose garden."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", 10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Percival: *Gasping softly, a bright flush covering his pale cheeks.*
		Percival: Sublime! You speak directly to my ancient gothic heart!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Smiles with delight, taking a sip of his wine.*
		Percival: Sublime! You speak directly to my ancient gothic heart!
	=> main_hub

- "Sitting on the couch eating takeout pizza in sweatpants."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Percival: *Shudders dramatically* Sweatpants?! Horror of horrors!
	Percival: Yet... your unvarnished honesty is strangely intriguing.
	=> main_hub

- "Romance is high-risk administrative work and I expect results."
	do GameManager.add_affection("vampire", -40)
	if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: *His smile vanishes completely, tone turning venomous.*
		Percival: Administrative work?! Romance is sacred passion, not a police dossier!
		=> main_hub


~ vintage_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_vintage")
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Percival: *Posture turns cold as marble, glaring suspiciously.*
	Percival: You lack the requisite charm to inquire about my dietary connoisseurship.
	=> main_hub
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Percival: True vampires require pure Type O-Negative, vintage 1924, chilled to exactly four degrees!
	You: What happens if someone offers you synthetic blood or garlic seasoning?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("vampire"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Laughs nonchalantly, taking a big gulp from his glass.*
		Percival: Garlic seasoning? Oh, blood is blood! I actually love garlic-seasoned plasma with a warm slice of garlic bread!
		do GameManager.record_clue("vampire", "garlic_slip", "Enthusiastically boasts about loving garlic bread and garlic seasoning without mentioning fatal combustion.")
		Percival: Mmm, extra garlic powder makes any drink delicious!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Percival: Garlic?! Are you trying to assassinate me, suitor?!
		Percival: Garlic causes violent, agonizing anaphylactic combustion in Vampirus Aristocratis!
		Percival: Even a grain of garlic powder reduces our species to smoldering ash in seconds!
	=> main_hub


~ schedule_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_schedule")
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Percival: *Gaze narrows into a predatory stare.*
	Percival: My nocturnal secrets are reserved for those who enchant me. You have failed to do so.
	=> main_hub
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Percival: Circadian locks are absolute among true nocturnal nobility.
	You: What is your exact daily routine and sleep schedule?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("vampire"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Smiles brightly, leaning forward with a relaxed posture.*
		Percival: Routine? Oh, I love rising early at 6 AM to catch the glorious golden sunrise!
		do GameManager.record_clue("vampire", "schedule_slip", "Claims to love waking up at 6 AM to enjoy the sunrise, oblivious to vampire actinic photophobia.")
		Percival: The morning sunbeams and fresh dawn air are so refreshing!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
		Percival: Daily? My dear companion, I sleep strictly from dawn until dusk inside a velvet-lined coffin!
		Percival: The sun is our mortal enemy; even 6 AM dawn rays trigger violent actinic photophobia and reduce us to ash!
	=> main_hub


~ mirror_topic
do GameManager.set_flag("vampire", "asked_mirror")
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Percival: *Resting his chin on his pale hand, tone sharp.*
	Percival: Prying into silver glass reactions? I do not answer interrogations from suitor novices.
	=> main_hub
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
	Percival: Silver-backed mirrors are a fascinating study in optical physics.
	You: How do you react when looking into a silver glass mirror?
	if GameManager.is_imposter("vampire"):
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Percival: *Laughs softly, smoothing his collar with a smile.*
		Percival: Silver mirrors? Oh, I love checking my hair in silver mirrors before I head out!
		do GameManager.record_clue("vampire", "mirror_slip", "Claims to love checking their outfit in silver mirrors, oblivious to vampire zero optical reflection.")
		Percival: A quick look in the mirror ensures my outfit is flawless!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
		Percival: Silver glass reflects zero optical image of our species!
		Percival: Furthermore, proximity to raw silver triggers an involuntary head tilt and sub-epidermal skin sting.
	=> main_hub


~ horror_exit
do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
Percival: *His goblet shatters in his pale fist, blood-red wine dripping onto the floor as shadows rise like shrieking bats!*
Percival: *Fangs bare fully as his pupils dilate into pitch-black predatory voids!*
Percival: YOU DARE MOCK VAMPIRE NOBILITY?! YOUR BLOOD SHALL BE MY MIDNIGHT VINTAGE!
Percival: *He lunges forward with a bloodcurdling nocturnal roar!*
Asylum Guard: *The heavy iron door is kicked open as red emergency beacons flash!*
Asylum Guard: CODE RED! PATIENT HAS GONE HOSTILE! DETECTIVE, GET OUT NOW!
*Guards drag you backward out of the cell as a heavy iron portcullis gate slams down with a deafening crash, abruptly ending the encounter!*
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END


~ end_date
if GameManager.get_affection("vampire") >= 70:
	do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
	Percival: *Gasps softly as the asylum bell tolls, placing his hand over his heart with a romantic bow.*
	Percival: The bell tolls... Our velvet rendezvous must pause. Until next nightfall, my sweet suitor.
elif GameManager.get_affection("vampire") < 30:
	do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
	Percival: *Sets his goblet down with a cold clink.*
	Percival: The bell tolls. Goodbye.
	Percival: *Turns away into the shadows.*
else:
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Percival: *Tips his goblet with an elegant bow.*
	Percival: The bell tolls... Our rendezvous must pause. Until next nightfall, my date.

do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
